SUMMARY:Scenic AVL #2 - Warren Wilson Redux
DESCRIPTION:The Asheville Hiking Group\nMostly flat but long double lollip
 op starting in at Berea Baptist Church on Riceville Rd\, passing the Warre
 n Wilson farm and continuing along the river trail.\n\nRating: Moderate\nP
 ace: 3.2 mph\nSurface: Trail\nDistance: 8 mile\nElevation Gain: 400 (short
  ups and downs\nWildlife/Animals: Warren Wilson Farm\, pigs and sheep. Thi
 s is a great area for birdwatching.\nDogs: Well behaved dogs are welcome .
  Conserving Carolina preserve requires all dogs to be leashed\n\nWe leave 
 on time\, but if you are late\, you can intercept us. I will post Intercep
 t instructions in comments later.\n\nGeneral Rout\n- All Trails[ Ma](https
 ://www.alltrails.com/explore/map/warren-wilson-from-berea-baptist-church-9
 6ebc5c)p\n- Start Berea Baptist Church\n\nAfter Eats Mexican food on Tunne
 l Road or similar\n\nScenic Asheville Series: There are 9[ hikes in the se
 ries\; hike them all a](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1XUm-X1_Ohx
 KIi8JU5rhjsW37cAl4yYx8yB_NEjjI5Lk)nd receive an attractive badge for your 
 backpack\n\nWe will start the hike on time\, no waiting. This hike is long
 \, and so we need to leave on tim\n\nThis is a *mostl*y flat hike\, and we
  will push the pace to complete in around 2.5 hours. If we run late\, we w
 ill short the lollipop. If anyone has trouble keeping up\, they will be ad
 vised to head back at the halfway point\n\nBring a headlamp\, poles\, jack
 et\, and snacks\n\nThis is a revised version of the original Scenic AVL #2
 . Thanks to Jeanne S from the Mountains to Sea Meetup for making me aware 
 that these trails are open again ! For those of you who are regulars \, th
 e Waynesville #2 will be done as a wildcard going forward .
